        "id": "p1",
        "text": "I'm writing to apply for the Software Engineer position at Justworks. I'm drawn to the opportunity to own meaningful technical projects end-to-end on a team that clearly values both the product and the people building it."
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "At Salo Labs, I designed and deployed a multi-service Python backend on GCP Cloud Run, built a CI/CD pipeline with automated testing gating every deploy, and maintained a test suite of 100+ passing tests. I'd welcome the chance to bring that same ownership to Justworks' engineering team."
